[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0010","text":"——朝日，时间到了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0020","text":"喂——，差不多该结束了\n还要试衣服呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0030","text":"１、２……３、４……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0040","text":"……哈哈，真是投入啊\n——朝日！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0050","text":"啊，Producer先生……\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0060","text":"你看，事务所大家一起穿的配套服装到了\n想让你试试"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0070","text":"穿上这个，把刚才的舞蹈在舞台上跳出来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0080","text":"配套的……！\n我要试穿！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0090","text":"嗯。不过先休息一下\n等汗消了再穿吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700100_01_0100","text":"诶——\n我等不及了啦～！"}]
